2 2 + ax2 3 + 2x1x3 与g y1,y2,y3 =-y2 1 - y2 2 + a2y2 3 + 2y1y2 的秩相等\na≠0 .问:\n(I) 当a 为何值时, 仅存在可逆(非正交) 线性变换x = Py, 可将f x1,x2,x3 化为g y1,y2,y3 , 并求一\n个可逆矩阵P;\n(II) 当a 为何值时, 存在正交变换x = Qy, 将f x1,x2,x3 化为g y1,y2,y3 , 说明理由.","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-15-big-4.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-15-big-4.jpg","facets":["congruent","inertia","ortho_trans"]},{"id":"ll-hard-15-big-5","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":5,"pdf_page":210,"stem":"设二次型f x1,x2,x3 = xTAx = ax2 1 + ax2 2 + a-1 x2 3 + 2x1x3 - 2x2x3 a为常数,AT=A .\n(I) 求一个正交变换x = Qy 将f x1,x2,x3 化为标准形;\n(II) 设x = x1,x2,x3 T, 求方程xT aE-A 2x = 0 的全部解.","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-15-big-5.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-15-big-5.jpg","facets":["ortho_trans"]},{"id":"ll-hard-15-big-6","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":6,"pdf_page":210,"stem":"设二次型xTAx = a x2 1+x2 2+x2 + 2x1x2 + 2bx1x3 + 2x2x3, 在正交变换x = Qy 下的标准形为y2 1 +\n3\ny2 2 + 4y2 3, 其中AT = A.\n(I) 求a,b 的值及正交矩阵Q;\n(II) 若正定矩阵B 满足B2 = A + A*, 其中A*是A 的伴随矩阵, 求B.\nT + k2 2,0,1 T + 1,1,-2 T.其中","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad","la.eig.pd"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-15-big-6.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-15-big-6.jpg","facets":["ortho_trans","pd"]},{"id":"ll-hard-15-big-7","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":7,"pdf_page":211,"stem":"设A 是3 阶矩阵, 方程组AX = b 的通解为k1 -1,1,0\nb = 6,6,-12 T,k1,k2 为任意常数.\n(I) 求A;\n(II) 若A 的列向量组的极大线性无关组为α, 求一个3 维行向量β, 使得A2 = αβ;\n(III) 记X = x1,x2,x3 T, 求方程X TAX = 0 的全部解.","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-15-big-7.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-15-big-7.jpg","facets":["quad_eq"]},{"id":"ll-hard-15-big-8","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":8,"pdf_page":211,"stem":"设二次型f x1,x2,x3 = X TAX AT